— Let $Y = X_{i-s} - X_{i-r} - c$.
— Set $X_i$ to $y = Y \mod m$. Set $c$ to 1 if $Y < 0$, otherwise set $c$ to 0.
[Note 1: This algorithm corresponds to a modular linear function of the form $TA(x_i) = (a \cdot x_i) \mod b$, where $b$ is of the form $m^r - m^s + 1$ and $a = b - (b - 1)/m$. — end note]
The generation algorithm is given by $GA(x_i) = y$, where $y$ is the value produced as a result of advancing the engine's state as described above.
